## 📊 Medallion Architecture

This data pipeline adheres to the Medallion Hexagonal architecture in `skills/data-engineer`:

- `src/{{ package_name }}/application/model/`: Pydantic data contracts for boundary validation.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/application/stage/raw.py`: Bronze ingestion and quarantined corrupt records.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/application/stage/core_model.py`: Silver cleaning, typing, and deduplication with Polars.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/application/stage/business_view.py`: Gold analytical aggregations and KPIs via DuckDB SQL.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/infrastructure/orchestration/`: End-to-end pipeline orchestration.
- `src/{{ package_name }}/shared/exception/`: Fail-closed pipeline exceptions.

AI agents working in this repository should refer to [`AGENTS.md`](file:///home/romuald/Projects/Perso/Skills/AGENTS.md) for architectural rules and invariants.
